From 8d4d5befb40a333d4024a46ca264f6161acddb8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Port <port@local>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:34:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: iommu: arm,smmu: add SM6225 Adreno SMMU

Add qcom,sm6225-smmu-500 to the SMMU-500 compatible lists (the
generic list and the Adreno list) and to the Adreno clock-name
constraint shared with QCM2290, SM6115 and SM6125
("mem", "hlos", "iface").

The Khaje Adreno SMMU matches the SM6115 one in the shipping
device tree: same base address (0x59a0000), same interrupt
layout (global SPI 163, contexts 167-174) and the same three
clocks. No driver change is needed: the generic qcom,smmu-500
match entry already selects the impl0 data, and the driver
explicitly asks not to grow the per-SoC match list for parts
covered by it. This only gives the node a SoC-specific
compatible to describe the hardware, instead of describing
Khaje silicon as another SoC.

Compile-tested only (schema); not verified on hardware.

Signed-off-by: Port <port@local>
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml | 3 +++
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml
index 92d350b8e..02a5912ff 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/iommu/arm,smmu.yaml
@@ -51,6 +51,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,sdx75-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6115-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6125-smmu-500
+              - qcom,sm6225-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6350-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6375-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8150-smmu-500
@@ -93,6 +94,7 @@ properties:
               - qcom,sc8280xp-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6115-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm6125-smmu-500
+              - qcom,sm6225-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8150-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8250-smmu-500
               - qcom,sm8350-smmu-500
@@ -473,6 +475,7 @@ allOf:
                 - qcom,qcm2290-smmu-500
                 - qcom,sm6115-smmu-500
                 - qcom,sm6125-smmu-500
+                - qcom,sm6225-smmu-500
             - const: qcom,adreno-smmu
             - const: qcom,smmu-500
             - const: arm,mmu-500
